codex-octo-channel
==================

This product includes software developed as part of codex-octo-channel
(Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0).

The Octo/WuKongIM protocol layer under src/protocol/ (socket.ts,
api-fetch.ts, api-error.ts, types.ts) and the transport pattern in src/port.ts
are ported from:

  - Mininglamp-OSS/openclaw-channel-octo
    https://github.com/Mininglamp-OSS/openclaw-channel-octo (Apache-2.0)
  - 782042369/dsh-octo-channel
    https://github.com/782042369/dsh-octo-channel (Apache-2.0)

The conversation-key derivation in src/conversation.ts follows the same
scheme as dsh-octo-channel (Apache-2.0), which ports it from
whoisjiahao/dsh-feishu-channel (MIT).
